    "init_script": "import org.gradle.api.plugins.quality.Checkstyle\n\ngradle.projectsEvaluated {\n    def root = gradle.rootProject\n    def paths = new File('/tmp/simplepoint-persistence-style-files.txt').readLines().collect { root.file(it) }\n    def checks = []\n    root.allprojects.each { p ->\n        def sources = paths.findAll { it.toPath().startsWith(p.projectDir.toPath().resolve('src')) }\n        if (!sources.isEmpty()) {\n            checks.add(p.tasks.register('checkstylePersistence', Checkstyle) {\n                source sources\n                classpath = p.sourceSets.test.compileClasspath\n                configFile = root.file('checkstyle/google_checks.xml')\n                maxWarnings = 0\n                reports {\n                    xml.required = true\n                    html.required = true\n                }\n            })\n        }\n    }\n    root.tasks.register('verifyPersistenceStyle') { dependsOn checks }\n}\n",
    "note": "Scoped reports cover the listed sources; the 16 further legacy constructor/call-site migration files have targeted formatting and functional regressions, not a full legacy-module Checkstyle claim."
